  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 6th level, whenever a runesmith inscribes his runes for the day, he may inscribe two Least equipment runes on the same item as though they were a single Lesser rune. Similarly, he may inscribe two Least projection runes as though they were a single Lesser rune. Activating a combined rune activates both runes at once. The activation cost is equal to the greater of the activation costs of the two runes, and the activation time is equal to the greater of the activation times of the two runes.</p>\n<p>A runesmith may inscribe a single compound rune per day at 6th level, two per day at 10th level, and three per day at 18th level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/runesmith#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
